Author:     Genesis Transformation Experiment <genesis-local@example.invalid>
AuthorDate: Mon Oct 26 03:03:35 2026 -0400
Commit:     Genesis Transformation Experiment <genesis-local@example.invalid>
CommitDate: Mon Oct 26 03:03:35 2026 -0400

    Group related parameters into descriptor structs
    
    Several of the wide host interfaces passed long lists of individually
    named arguments that always travel together. Collect those into small
    descriptor structs and pass them as a unit:
    
    - momentum model constants for the serial FGH computation
    - grid dimensions for the serial scenario border setup
    - subdomain index bounds for the MPI border values
    - the process-grid split for MPI startup
    - domain geometry outputs from the case-config loader
    - the output grid for recorder setup
    - flow field arrays for the streamline integrator
    - the sampling grid for trajectory features
    
    Call sites are updated accordingly. Behaviour is unchanged.

